Depends: bluez, libc6 (>= 2.39), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, pipewire-bin, pipewire-pulse, pulseaudio-utils, python3, python3-dbus, python3-gi, udev
Description: SayAll RC003 Bluetooth voice bridge for Ubuntu
 Decode a paired Xiaomi remote's ATVV audio into a PipeWire microphone.
 The command-line bridge shares the ATVV implementation with the macOS app.
